OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785160095
OL,3,C'New suspect' being investigated over
OL,4,Cthe murders of Lin and Megan Russell
OL,6,FIt is one of Kent's most notorious
OL,7,Fkillings. Lin Russell and her 6-year-
OL,8,Fold daughter Megan were attacked on a
OL,9,Fcountry lane in Chillenden, Kent.
OL,10,FMegan's sister Josie, who was 9,
OL,11,Fsurvived.
OL,13,FMichael Stone has spent almost thirty
OL,14,Fyears behind bars for the murders. A
OL,15,Fcrime he says he didn't commit.
OL,17,FHis solicitor says new witnesses have
OL,18,Fcome forward to name another man,
OL,19,FRaymond Buck, as a possible suspect.
OL,20,FMr Buck has since died.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
