OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785160095
OL,3,C'New suspect' being investigated over
OL,4,Cthe murders of Lin and Megan Russell
OL,6,FKent Police say they're supporting the
OL,7,FCriminal Cases Review Commission's
OL,8,Fongoing review. Stone's lawyer Karen
OL,9,FTodner says it could finally clear him.
OL,11,FShe told ITV Meridian: "Two witnesses
OL,12,Fhave come forward. Both have given,
OL,13,Fwhat I believe, to be credible
OL,14,Fevidence that the perpetrator is a man
OL,15,Fby the name of Raymond Buck, who in
OL,16,Ffact took his own life in 2000.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785160095
OL,3,C'New suspect' being investigated over
OL,4,Cthe murders of Lin and Megan Russell
OL,6,F"One of the witnesses had a number of
OL,7,Fcontemporaneous documents...from the
OL,8,Fsummer of 1996 which totally supported
OL,9,Fwhat was being said. As well as
OL,10,Fpsychiatric reports and such. These
OL,11,Freally support everything that I was
OL,12,Fbeing told about what went on that
OL,13,Fsummer."
OL,15,FThe Criminal Cases Review Commission,
OL,16,Fwhich looks into miscarriages of
OL,17,Fjustice is assessing this claim.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785160095
OL,3,C'New suspect' being investigated over
OL,4,Cthe murders of Lin and Megan Russell
OL,6,FA CCRC spokesperson said: "A review
OL,7,Finto this application is ongoing. This
OL,8,Fis the fourth time the CCRC has
OL,9,Finvestigated Mr Stone's case. His 2003
OL,10,Fapplication was ineligible because an
OL,11,Fappeal was still live. The 2006
OL,12,Fapplication was closed in 2010 and
OL,13,Fwasn't referred. The 2017 application
OL,14,Fwas closed in July 2023 and wasn't
OL,15,Freferred.
OL,26,@nD@[OU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785160095
OL,3,C'New suspect' being investigated over
OL,4,Cthe murders of Lin and Megan Russell
OL,6,F"This fresh review commenced in
OL,7,FNovember 2023, and we are exploring
OL,8,Fall of the possibilities the
OL,9,Fapplication raises to determine
OL,10,Fwhether Mr Stone may have suffered a
OL,11,Fmiscarriage of justice.
OL,13,F"Considerable work has been done not
OL,14,Fonly on forensic aspects of the
OL,15,Fapplication but on the several other
OL,16,Faspects of the application which Mr
OL,17,FStone's lawyers wished to be
OL,18,Finvestigated.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785160095
OL,3,C'New suspect' being investigated over
OL,4,Cthe murders of Lin and Megan Russell
OL,6,F"A decision was made in May of this
OL,7,Fyear to collect a new DNA sample from
OL,8,FMr Stone, and this will take place on
OL,9,FThursday 9 July.
OL,11,F"Our test for referring a case is that
OL,12,Fthere is a real possibility that the
OL,13,FCourt of Appeal would overturn his
OL,14,Fconviction, a test which was not met
OL,15,Fin any of the earlier applications.
OL,17,F"It would be inappropriate for us to
OL,18,Fmake any further comment while the
OL,19,Fapplication is being reviewed."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785160095
OL,3,C'New suspect' being investigated over
OL,4,Cthe murders of Lin and Megan Russell
OL,6,FDetective Chief Inspector Neil Kimber,
OL,7,Fof Kent Police, said: "During the
OL,8,Finvestigation into the murders of Lin
OL,9,Fand Megan Russell and the attempted
OL,10,Fmurder of Josie Russell in 1996,
OL,11,Fnumerous members of public contacted
OL,12,Fthe police with the names of people
OL,13,Fthey thought may have been responsible.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785160095
OL,3,C'New suspect' being investigated over
OL,4,Cthe murders of Lin and Megan Russell
OL,6,F"Each piece of information was
OL,7,Freviewed and, in some cases, led to
OL,8,Ffurther enquiries into some
OL,9,Findividuals. This included contact
OL,10,Fwith a relative of a man with
OL,11,Fconnections to the Folkestone and
OL,12,FLondon areas during the original
OL,13,Finvestigation and, in 2017,
OL,14,Fdiscussions with another of his
OL,15,Frelatives.
OL,17,F"The information provided in each case
OL,18,Fwas comprehensively examined in full
OL,19,Fby the investigation team.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785160095
OL,3,C'New suspect' being investigated over
OL,4,Cthe murders of Lin and Megan Russell
OL,6,F"Following two trials at which Michael
OL,7,FStone was found guilty by a jury on
OL,8,Fboth occasions, and an appeal to the
OL,9,FHigh Court, he remains convicted of
OL,10,Fthe murders of Lin and Megan Russell
OL,11,Fand the attempted murder of Josie
OL,12,FRussell in 1996.
OL,14,F"Stone made an application to apply
OL,15,Ffor a Judicial Review in respect of
OL,16,Fhis conviction in September 2012. The
OL,17,FHonourable Mr Justice Blake ordered
OL,18,Fthat permission for the application
OL,19,Fshould be refused.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785160095
OL,3,C'New suspect' being investigated over
OL,4,Cthe murders of Lin and Megan Russell
OL,6,F"Kent Police has supported the
OL,7,FCriminal Cases Review Commission by
OL,8,Fproviding all the relevant information
OL,9,Frequired throughout its ongoing review
OL,10,Fof Stone's conviction and will
OL,11,Fcontinue to do so."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G10/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
